see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".
see "../src/gen_process.vox".
see "../src/gen_expressions.vox".
see "../src/gen_keywords.vox".
see "../src/gen_basics.vox".

(The ledger's file leaves, batch B2 - docs/ledger/files.md rows FIL-45,
 FIL-52, FIL-53, FIL-54, FIL-55, FIL-56, FIL-70, FIL-75, FIL-80, FIL-93.

 Same shape as 380_gen_files_b.vox: each leaf called directly off a
 pinned rng seed, its emitted source printed in full as the golden,
 rendered both at the true top level (nested false) and inside a block
 (nested true) - the two ways 'gen join lines' can render a line.

 These leaves write files, which interpolate the scratch flag's name -
 a live program gets that from its manifest; this test names one
 itself, the same as 380_gen_files_b.vox does.)
Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.

Print "--- FIL-45: Read replaces the buffer, not appends ---".
'rng seed' of 31.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file read replaces' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 31.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file read replaces' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-52, FIL-53, FIL-54, FIL-55: Read line mechanics ---".
'rng seed' of 17.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line mechanics' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 17.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line mechanics' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-56: Read line truncates a fixed buffer, sets the error flag ---".
'rng seed' of 8.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line truncation' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-70: is available, both directions ---".
'rng seed' of 13.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf path available' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-75: Delete the file, then confirm gone ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file delete' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-80: an open of a path that cannot exist is catchable ---".
'rng seed' of 19.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file open error' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-93: descriptors strictly increase while every handle stays open ---".
'rng seed' of 27.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file descriptor tracking' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

(A program that never committed to file I/O was never given a path, so
 every leaf above must stand aside for the plain-print leaf instead of
 inventing one - the same guarantee 380_gen_files_b.vox already checks
 for batch B's own leaves.)
Print "--- every leaf above with no file I/O committed ---".
Set gen_does_file_io to false.
'rng seed' of 31.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file read replaces' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 17.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line mechanics' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 8.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line truncation' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 13.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf path available' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file delete' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 19.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file open error' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 27.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file descriptor tracking' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.
